+<main>
+<section class="wrap hero"><div class="eyebrow">Pricing that makes sense</div><h1>Good work starts with a better conversation.</h1><p>Everything your team needs to work together. Nothing it doesn’t.</p><div class="billing"><span>Monthly</span><label class="switch"><input id="yearly" type="checkbox" aria-label="Toggle yearly billing"><span class="track" aria-hidden="true"></span></label><span>Yearly</span><span class="save">Save 20%</span></div></section>
+<section class="wrap plans" id="plans" aria-label="Plans and pricing">
+<article class="card"><h2 class="plan-name">Free</h2><p class="description">A calmer way for small teams to get started.</p><div class="price"><span class="amount" data-month="0" data-year="0">$0</span><span class="per">/ user / month</span></div><div class="billing-note">Free forever</div><hr><div class="list-label">INCLUDED</div><ul class="features"><li><span class="check">✓</span> Up to 10 members</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> 1:1 and group messaging</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> 5 GB shared storage</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> 90-day message history</li></ul><a class="button" href="mailto:hello@relay.example?subject=Relay%20Free">Get started free</a></article>
+<article class="card featured"><span class="ribbon">MOST POPULAR</span><h2 class="plan-name">Team</h2><p class="description">For teams that want to do their best work together.</p><div class="price"><span class="amount" data-month="8" data-year="6.40">$8</span><span class="per">/ user / month</span></div><div class="billing-note" data-note="team">Billed monthly</div><hr><div class="list-label">EVERYTHING IN FREE, PLUS</div><ul class="features"><li><span class="check">✓</span> Unlimited message history</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> Unlimited integrations</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> 20 GB storage per member</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> Audio and video huddles</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> Priority support</li></ul><a class="button primary" href="mailto:hello@relay.example?subject=Relay%20Team">Start your free trial</a></article>
