+<section class="section" id="compare"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Compare plans</h2><p>All the details, side by side.</p></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Feature</th><th scope="col" class="table-plan">Free</th><th scope="col" class="table-plan highlight">Team</th><th scope="col" class="table-plan">Business</th></tr></thead><tbody>
+<tr><th scope="row">Members</th><td>Up to 10</td><td class="highlight">Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Message history</th><td>90 days</td><td class="highlight">Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Storage per member</th><td>5 GB shared</td><td class="highlight">20 GB</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">App integrations</th><td>10</td><td class="highlight">Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Audio &amp; video huddles</th><td class="no" aria-label="Not included">—</td><td class="highlight yes" aria-label="Included">✓</td><td class="yes" aria-label="Included">✓</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">SAML single sign-on</th><td class="no" aria-label="Not included">—</td><td class="no" aria-label="Not included">—</td><td class="yes" aria-label="Included">✓</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Priority support</th><td class="no" aria-label="Not included">—</td><td class="highlight yes" aria-label="Included">✓</td><td class="yes" aria-label="Included">✓</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Uptime SLA</th><td class="no" aria-label="Not included">—</td><td class="no" aria-label="Not included">—</td><td>99.99%</td></tr>
+</tbody></table></div></div></section>
+<section class="wrap faq" id="faq"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Questions, answered.</h2><p>A few things you might be wondering.</p></div><details><summary>Can I try a paid plan before committing?</summary><p>Absolutely. Team includes a 14-day free trial, with no credit card required. You can invite your whole team and explore everything before choosing.</p></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><p>Choose yearly billing with the switch above and you’ll save 20% per user. The yearly total is billed upfront; you can change plans or cancel at any time.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change plans later?</summary><p>Yes. Upgrade or downgrade whenever you need to. When you upgrade, we’ll prorate the difference; downgrades take effect at your next billing date.</p></details><details><summary>What happens when my trial ends?</summary><p>Your workspace moves to the Free plan unless you choose a paid plan. Your messages and files stay safe, and we’ll send a reminder before the trial ends.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer discounts for nonprofits?</summary><p>We do. Nonprofits and qualifying educational organizations can get in touch with our team to learn about discounted plans.</p></details></section>
+</main><footer class="footer"><div class="wrap"><span>© 2025 Relay. Better work, together.</span><a href="mailto:hello@relay.example">Questions? Talk to us</a></div></footer>
+<script>
